{"id":"7a2aa75ce7e4d78f","group":"62","path":"62/62-df-Sigma11-separation.md","title":"Sigma-One-One Separation Schema","display":"df-Sigma11-separation — Sigma-One-One Separation Schema","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)","book_abbrev":"62","label":"62-df-Sigma11-separation","aliases":["62-df-Sigma11-separation"],"display":"df-Sigma11-separation — Sigma-One-One Separation Schema","depends_on":["[[62-df-AnalyticHierarchy]]","[[62-df-L2]]"],"source":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Theorem V.5.1","source_pages":[190],"source_pdf_pages":[208]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"62"},{"key":"label","html":"62-df-Sigma11-separation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>62-df-Sigma11-separation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-Sigma11-separation — Sigma-One-One Separation Schema"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8535a715d3193fba\" href=\"?note=8535a715d3193fba\" title=\"62-df-AnalyticHierarchy\">62-df-AnalyticHierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4c6d2d9f1999915f\" href=\"?note=4c6d2d9f1999915f\" title=\"62-df-L2\">62-df-L2</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Theorem V.5.1"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>190</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>208</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^1_1(S_2)\">\\(\\Sigma^1_1(S_2)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8535a715d3193fba\" href=\"?note=8535a715d3193fba\" title=\"62-df-AnalyticHierarchy\">62-df-AnalyticHierarchy</a>，UC 与自由集合变量见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4c6d2d9f1999915f\" href=\"?note=4c6d2d9f1999915f\" title=\"62-df-L2\">62-df-L2</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\">\\(Z\\)</span> 是不在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_0,\\varphi_1\">\\(\\varphi_0,\\varphi_1\\)</span> 中自由出现的新集合变量。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in V_N\">\\(n\\in V_N\\)</span> 是模式的固定指定数变量；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\\in V_S\">\\(Z\\in V_S\\)</span> 的选择由下式绑定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}Sigma11\\text{-}separation}\\vdash\\;\\Sigma^1_1\\text{-}\\mathrm{Sep}(S_2)\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{UC}(\\neg\\exists n(\\varphi_1\\land\\varphi_0)\\to\n\\exists Z\\forall n[(\\varphi_1\\to n\\in Z)\\land(\\varphi_0\\to n\\notin Z)]):\\varphi_0,\\varphi_1\\in\\Sigma^1_1(S_2),\\ Z\\in V_S\\setminus(\\mathrm{FV}_2(\\varphi_0)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}_2(\\varphi_1))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}Sigma11\\text{-}separation}\\vdash\\;\\Sigma^1_1\\text{-}\\mathrm{Sep}(S_2)\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{UC}(\\neg\\exists n(\\varphi_1\\land\\varphi_0)\\to\n\\exists Z\\forall n[(\\varphi_1\\to n\\in Z)\\land(\\varphi_0\\to n\\notin Z)]):\\varphi_0,\\varphi_1\\in\\Sigma^1_1(S_2),\\ Z\\in V_S\\setminus(\\mathrm{FV}_2(\\varphi_0)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}_2(\\varphi_1))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>只要求将两个互不相交的定义类分开；不要求 Z 等于其中任何一个。数参数、集合参数由实例的 UC 绑定。此模式与 ATR₀ 关联，不能与 Δ⁰₁ 理解或无条件 Σ¹₁ 理解混同。</p>\n<p>来源：第二版（2009），Theorem V.5.1；纸面页 190；PDF 页 208。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"62-df-AnalyticHierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"8535a715d3193fba","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数